# Keep the build context to what actually compiles. Anything listed here that
# changes would otherwise invalidate the COPY layer and force a full rebuild.
.git
.gitignore
.serena
.claude

# Secrets and local state never belong in an image: .env carries the dashboard
# password, and the database carries every key hash and usage row.
.env
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal

# Docs and the deployment files themselves are not inputs to `go build`.
README.md
CHANGELOG.md
docs
Dockerfile
compose.yaml
.dockerignore
